        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Standard Duty Commercial One-Sided Deadbolt</b>\r\n<p>\r\nSatin chrome finished One-Sided Commercial Deadbolt with universal adjustable backset and 1 inch throw bolt. Uses thumbturn inside but it does not go through to the outside of the door (No External Plate). Includes reinforced strike plate, easy to install on almost any door.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/commercial-one-sided-deadbolt-with-exterior-plate-pdq-kv125bk-626\"><b>One-Sided Deadbolt With Exterior Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/satin-chrome-standard-duty-commercial-deadbolt-pdq-kv-series\"><b>Standard Duty Commercial Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nU.L., U.L.C. Listed, UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, UL10B Neutral Pressure Rated.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for PDQ KV125-626 Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-1/4\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt:: 1\" throw with case-hardened roller pin. Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 2-3/4\" x 1-1/8\". Brass</li>\r\n<li>Trim Material: Wrought Brass</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>626 - Brushed Chrome Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. <b>No Exterior Trim Plate</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
